      "video": "tablet recording",
      "summary": "A person recorded a 2 s demonstration video of a task for the robot arm.\nObjects in the scene: white white_power_strip, black black_plugs, white white_cable, black black_cables, green rice_cake_box, blue snack_bag, black black_pouch, black keyboard, clear plastic_cup, white right_power_strip, black power_adapter, white cable_holder.\nActions, in order:\n- 0.0-0.9s: attendere [wait] \n- 0.9-2.0s: osservare [unknown] \n- 2.0-2.4s: attendere [wait] \nWrite a skill that makes the robot arm reproduce this task: detect each object first, pick, place at the same destination, verify, then go home. Keep the same order. The arm's camera is on its head and it knows four objects: orange screw, blue bucket, green ring, white bucket lid; map what the person handled to the closest of these. Putting something in a cup/bucket/container means into the blue bucket; putting it to one side or on a pad means the delivery zone.",
      "tokens": 3
    }
